---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/layout/Footer.astro';
import Container from '../../components/ui/Container.astro';
import Section from '../../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Badge from '../../components/ui/Badge.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 8, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="PELAV PDF Scanner Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for PELAV PDF Scanner, developed by Continuum Dataguard Technologies: how the app handles documents, local storage, sharing, and its use of Google ML Kit Document Scanner."
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <Section>
    <Container class="max-w-3xl">
      <Badge>Privacy Policy</Badge>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl text-paper">PELAV PDF Scanner Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-mist">
        PELAV PDF Scanner is an Android application developed and published by Continuum
        Dataguard Technologies ("Continuum", "we", "us"). This Privacy Policy explains how the
        app handles information when you scan documents and create PDF files.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-mist">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-10">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">How PELAV PDF Scanner processes your documents</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            PELAV PDF Scanner is designed to work as a local, on-device document scanning tool.
            In this version of the app (V1), Continuum does not operate a cloud backend or
            server for PELAV PDF Scanner, and the app does not automatically upload or
            synchronise your scanned documents to any Continuum-controlled cloud storage.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            When you scan a document, the app captures source images and generates a PDF file,
            which is stored in the app's own private application storage on your device — not in
            shared or public storage accessible to other apps. Intermediate scanner images used to
            produce the PDF are cleaned up automatically once the PDF has been generated
            successfully. If PDF generation fails for any reason, the source images are
            deliberately not deleted, so that your only copy of the captured document is not lost.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Sharing your documents</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            PELAV PDF Scanner does not share, transmit or upload your generated PDF files anywhere
            on its own. Document sharing only happens when you explicitly choose to share a file
            using Android's built-in system sharing mechanism (for example, to send a PDF to
            another app, contact, or service of your choosing). What happens to a document after
            you share it is governed by the privacy practices of the app or service you chose to
            share it with.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Google ML Kit Document Scanner and Google Play services</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            PELAV PDF Scanner uses Google's ML Kit Document Scanner through Google Play services.
            Google's documentation states that the Document Scanner models, scanning logic and
            user interface are dynamically downloaded by Google Play services. PELAV itself does
            not operate a backend server or upload scanned documents to PELAV-controlled cloud
            storage.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            Google Play services and Google services may communicate with Google infrastructure
            for their own operation, including downloading or updating the scanner components.
            Such processing is governed by Google's own terms and privacy practices — see
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-paper hover:text-signal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> Google's Privacy Policy</a>
            for more information.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Accounts, analytics and advertising</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            PELAV PDF Scanner does not require or offer user accounts, registration or login in
            this version of the app. Continuum does not implement its own analytics or advertising
            services within PELAV PDF Scanner, and does not use the app to collect information for
            marketing purposes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Data retention and deletion</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            Generated PDF files remain in the app's private storage until they are removed by the
            operating system's app-data lifecycle, or until you uninstall the app or clear its
            app data — either of which removes the app's private storage, including generated
            PDFs. This version of the app does not currently provide an in-app document
            library or delete function for managing previously generated PDFs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Your rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            Continuum Dataguard Technologies is based in South Africa. Where applicable, South
            Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA) gives individuals rights in
            relation to their personal information, including the right to request access to,
            correction of, or deletion of personal information held about them, and the right to
            lodge a complaint with the Information Regulator. If you are located in another
            jurisdiction, you may have additional rights under applicable local privacy and
            data-protection laws.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Children's privacy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            PELAV PDF Scanner is not directed at children, and we do not knowingly collect
            personal information from children through the app.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            This policy may be updated from time to time to reflect changes to PELAV PDF Scanner
            or applicable law. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last
            updated" date.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-paper">Contact us about this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-mist">
            Questions or requests regarding this policy or your personal information can be
            directed to:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm text-paper">Continuum Dataguard Technologies</p>
            <p class="font-mono text-sm text-mist">Durban, KwaZulu-Natal, South Africa</p>
            <a href="mailto:admin@continuumdataguardtech.co.za" class="font-mono text-sm text-paper hover:text-signal">
              admin@continuumdataguardtech.co.za
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </Section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>
